 Historic Volatility is the volatility of the underlying stock.
   - It has already been realized
   - Bolinger Band or a plot of Bolinger Band Bandwidth is a good measure ( https://www.tradingview.com/x/QBzNoyzL/)

 Implied Volatility (IV) is a property of the Options Contract (NOT THE STOCK)
   - Sites prescribing IV to a stock are likely using IV of ATM contracts for near contracts



